      "content": "but it's not just a pause. it's more like... they've already moved on to a world where i don't belong. i'm just staring at a screen and seeing everyone living their lives and it's like i'm watching a movie of a life i'm not even a part of anymore. it feels more real to just accept that i'm gone than to keep trying to pretend i'm still here. like, what's the point of being a person if nobody even sees you?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
